# public/fonts — IBM Plex + Comfortaa giant self-host (C12 OFL note)

16 × `*.woff2` only (no italic, no cyrillic/greek/latin-ext):

- Sans 400/500/600/700 × latin+vietnamese (8):
  `ibm-plex-sans-{latin,vietnamese}-{400,500,600,700}-normal.woff2`
- Mono 400/500/600 × latin+vietnamese (6):
  `ibm-plex-mono-{latin,vietnamese}-{400,500,600}-normal.woff2`
- Comfortaa 700 × latin+vietnamese (2, giant sign-off ONLY per UI-SPEC):
  `comfortaa-{latin,vietnamese}-700-normal.woff2`

Source of files only: `npm i @fontsource/ibm-plex-sans @fontsource/ibm-plex-mono @fontsource/comfortaa`
copied from `node_modules/@fontsource/*/files/`. No `@fontsource` JS/CSS
imports in prod code (C09). Total 209284 bytes (Plex 191212 + Comfortaa 18072;
C15 200KB budget now +4KB over — accepted: giant Comfortaa is UI-SPEC-locked).

License: SIL Open Font License 1.1 (OFL).
Upstream: https://github.com/IBM/plex + https://fontsource.org/fonts/ibm-plex-sans
and https://fontsource.org/fonts/ibm-plex-mono + https://fontsource.org/fonts/comfortaa
